{{<shell}}{{$content}}
<h1>Places</h1>
<p class="hint">The address book: the places this community cares about. What each kind of place
  records is up to you &mdash; a ranch has different things worth writing down than a vendor or a
  venue &mdash; and that is set under <a href="{{kindsUrl}}">Kinds</a>.</p>
{{^anyKinds}}<p class="problem">There are no kinds of place yet.
  <a href="{{kindsUrl}}">Add one first &rarr;</a></p>{{/anyKinds}}
{{#anyKinds}}<div class="doing"><a class="btn" href="{{newUrl}}">{{{plusIcon}}}New address</a>
  <a class="btn secondary" href="{{kindsUrl}}">Kinds</a>
  <a class="btn secondary" href="{{publicUrl}}">See what members see</a></div>{{/anyKinds}}
<form class="filters" data-filters method="get" action="{{panelUrl}}">
  <input type="search" name="q" value="{{q}}" placeholder="name, address or kind">
  <button type="submit">Search</button>
</form>
<div class="panel" data-panel="{{panelUrl}}">{{{panel}}}</div>
{{/content}}{{/shell}}
